  m_text: "Grab the ball by holding Left Mouse Button and throw it by clicking Right
    Mouse Button \n\nWhen Holding a ball its number will be diplayed at the bottom
    of the screen\n\nWhen inserting the ball in a possible slot the node will be
    colored black with the number appearing in a pink color\n\nA timer and score
    will be set and the game ends when the timer ends or the balls are correctly
    placed \n\n \n\n"
  m_isRightToLeft: 0
  m_fontAsset: {fileID: 11400000, guid: 8f586378b4e144a9851e7b34d9b748ee, type: 2}
